# Mirror medseb and reimed

`medseb` and `reimed` are sister apps. When you change one, apply the same change to the other unless the user says otherwise.

- Paths usually match (`src/...`, `prisma/...`).
- Adapt only if a file or feature exists in one repo and not the other.
- Do this in the same turn, not as a follow-up.
